=== Odisha School ===
The ''Odisha'' school or sub-style originated in the coastal regions of [[East India]], especially the present [[States and union territories of India|Indian state]] of [[Odisha]] and [[Andhra Pradesh]]. This school or sub-style of temple construction is also known as ''[[Kalinga architecture|''Kalinga'']]'' School or sub-style.{{Sfn|Rastogi|2023|p=6}}{{Sfn|Dey|2022|p=86}}

